# purpose: part A of the replay pair. The test runs A, writes the journal, starts a fresh
#          engine from that journal, then runs replay-b.in - and expects the same output as
#          running A and B in one go. Records 15 facts, so a sequence counter that restarts
#          is visible immediately in B.
# exercises: journal + replay of every M1/M2 fact type: opened, deposited, withdrawn, frozen,
#            unfrozen, closed.
OPEN alice USD
OPEN bob EUR
OPEN carol GBP
DEPOSIT alice 100
DEPOSIT bob 200
DEPOSIT carol 300
WITHDRAW alice 40
WITHDRAW bob 0.5
FREEZE carol
DEPOSIT carol 1
UNFREEZE carol
WITHDRAW carol 300
CLOSE carol
FREEZE bob
OPEN dave USD
DEPOSIT dave 12.34
BALANCE alice
